        <cve>CVE-2026-94399</cve>
    </suppress>
    <suppress until="2026-12-29Z">
        <notes><![CDATA[
        Reviewed 2026-09-30 against elasticsearch-x-content-9.1.2-sources.jar:
        this artifact contains the XContent serialization/parsing abstraction and
        JSON, YAML, CBOR and Smile support, not the Elasticsearch server or its
        search aggregation/index analysis execution. Dependency-check has matched
        this library to the whole Elasticsearch server product for these CVEs.
        Scope is this artifact/version only; server artifacts and the separately
        deployed Elasticsearch cluster remain subject to vulnerability checks.
        Reassess on version/architecture changes or before expiry.
        Source: https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/tree/v9.1.2/libs/x-content
        Advisories: https://discuss.elastic.co/t/390681
        https://discuss.elastic.co/t/390682
        https://discuss.elastic.co/t/390683
        https://discuss.elastic.co/t/390684
        https://discuss.elastic.co/t/390687
        ]]></notes>
